      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.hudsonrivervalley.org/annandale"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The original land was transferred in 1660 from Native owners to Peter Schuyler, an Albany merchant and colonial official.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
